Package: rMVPA
Type: Package
Title: Multivoxel Pattern Analysis in R
Version: 0.1.3
Date: 2026-10-01
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1108-4866"))
Description: Multivariate pattern analysis of functional neuroimaging
    data. Provides searchlight and region-of-interest decoding with
    cross-validation for classification and regression, representational
    similarity analysis (including cross-validated Mahalanobis
    'crossnobis' distances), and permutation-based inference with
    searchlight-size-adjusted null distributions. Common classifiers and
    representational similarity models are fitted by exact searchlight
    engines that share computation across spheres. Methods follow Haxby
    et al. (2001) <doi:10.1126/science.1063736>, Kriegeskorte, Goebel and
    Bandettini (2006) <doi:10.1073/pnas.0600244103>, Kriegeskorte, Mur and
    Bandettini (2008) <doi:10.3389/neuro.06.004.2008>, Walther et al.
    (2016) <doi:10.1016/j.neuroimage.2015.12.012>, and Ahdesmaki and
    Strimmer (2010) <doi:10.1214/09-AOAS277>.
